description	"The Sith Ritualist

Focuses mostly on force powers but does not completely sacrifice lightsaber abilities. Has access to unique force powers like blinding and deadly sight.

^2Weaponry:
- Dual Lightsabers
-- ^2Dual ^7Style Only
-- Saber / Blaster Defense (1)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump  (1)
- Push  (3)
- Pull  (3)
- Absorb (3)
- Blind (1)
- Lightning (2)
- Grip  (3)
- Drain (3)
- Deadly Sight (1)
- Repulse ^5[CS1 Melee]

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (3)
- Force Focus (2)
- CTF: 35s Respawn

^2Strengths^7: Very strong array of force powers and supportive abilities, effectively counters Sages/Sorcerers.
^1Weaknesses^7: Poor lightsaber attack/defense low health pool. Least mobile of all Jedi/Sith Classes."